Origin: DHI, adapting https://github.com/codecov/codecov-gateway/blob/main/entrypoint.sh
Description: Run the upstream gateway entrypoint on the hardened package layout.
 The HAProxy templates are read from /etc/codecov-gateway, where the package
 installs them read-only, and are still rendered into /etc/haproxy, the one
 directory the runtime user owns. The preflight tests each backend by nc's exit
 status instead of grepping BusyBox's "open" message, so it also works with the
 OpenBSD netcat the Debian variant ships. BUILD_ID defaults to the commit id the
 package records, so /gateway_health reports "<version> <commit>" as upstream.
Forwarded: not-needed
Upstream: https://github.com/codecov/codecov-gateway (tag self-hosted-26.4.1)
